This project contains Linux kernel drivers and device trees. They are
licensed GPL-2.0-only, the same terms as the kernel they are built into.

The full licence text is the one shipped with the Linux kernel as
COPYING / LICENSES/preferred/GPL-2.0, and is reproduced here by reference:

    https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/process/license-rules.html
    https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-2.0-only.html

Every source file carries its own SPDX identifier. Files taken unchanged from
Samsung's vendor kernel (notably the UFS PHY calibration) keep the licence
they were published under there; files vendored from other projects keep
theirs and are listed in THIRD-PARTY.md.
